<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{% block title %}Finportill | Privacy Policy
{% endblock %}</title>

    {% block stylesheets %}
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Work+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: #15161b !important;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
        }
        /* 🏛️ MÜHÜRLÜ ARKA PLAN ZIRHI: Gradyan çakışmasını engellemek için doğrudan CSS katmanı */
        .seaport-bg-layer {
            position: absolute !important;
            inset: 0 !important;
            z-index: 0 !important;
            background-color: #15161b !important;
        }
        .seaport-bg-layer img {
            width: 100% !important;
            height: 100% !important;
            object-fit: cover !important;
            opacity: 0.5 !important; 
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block javascripts %}
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        darkBg: '#15161b',
                        brand: '#e87b51'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
{% endblock %}

</head>
<body>

{% block body %}
<div class="antialiased">

    <div class="relative w-full h-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8 lg:p-16 select-none">
        
        <div class="seaport-bg-layer">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1746211038760-6738eaf707eb?q=80&w=889&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Server Architecture">
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 w-full flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[#C9A961]">The Bellisan Labs // Project Deployment</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase">System: Live</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col justify-center items-center my-auto space-y-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[#C9A961] bg-[#C9A961]/5 px-4 py-1.5 border border-[#C9A961]/10">
                Portfolio - Analysis - Report
            </span>
            
            <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-light tracking-[0.1em] text-white uppercase font-serif italic">
                FinPortill
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-sm font-light text-white/70 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
               FinPortill — Account Deletion
<br>
To delete your FinPortill account and associated data:
1. Open the FinPortill app
2. Go to Profile
3. Tap "Delete Account"
4. Confirm the deletion
<br>
What gets deleted: your profile, race history, telemetry data, and account credentials.
What may be retained: [varsa yasal zorunluluktan tutulan veri, yoksa "No data is retained after deletion."]
<br>
If you're unable to access the app, contact us at [email] to request deletion.
           
<br>
            By using FinPortill, you agree to the Apple Licensed Application End User License Agreement 
			<a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/">(EULA) </a>
			Terms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/
 </p>
            <div class="pt-4">
                <a href="{{ path('app_finportill_terms') }}" class="inline-block border border-white/10 text-[#C9A961] font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase px-5 py-2 bg-[#15161b]/90">
                    FinPortill TERMS AND CONDITIONS
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-4">
                <a href="{{ path('app_finportill_privacy') }}" class="inline-block border border-white/10 text-[#C9A961] font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase px-5 py-2 bg-[#15161b]/90">
                    FINPORTILL PRIVACY
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 w-full flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] font-light text-white/30">
            <p class="m-0">© 2018 - 2026 The Bellisan. All rights reserved.</p>
            <a href="/" class="mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-white/60 hover:text-[#C9A961] no-underline tracking-widest uppercase transition-colors duration-300">
                ← Return to Command Center
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>

    <section id="contact" class="py-32 bg-darkBg text-white relative border-t border-white/5 z-20">
        <div class="max-w-[90rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
            <h4 class="text-brand text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-8">Get In Touch</h4>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 lg:gap-24">
                <div class="w-full lg:w-3/5">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-12">
                        Have an idea or a research concept that really excite you? Let's turn that idea into reality. Shoot me a message.
                    </h2>
                    <a href="mailto:info@thebellisan.com" class="inline-block w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-brand hover:bg-brandHover text-white text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase py-5 px-12 transition-colors duration-300">
                        Let's Talk
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="w-full lg:w-2/5 space-y-12 pt-4">
                    <div>
                        <h5 class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-2">Email</h5>
                        <a href="mailto:info@thebellisan.com" class="text-xl text-lightGray hover:text-white transition-colors">info@thebellisan.com</a>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h5 class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-bold mb-2">Location</h5>
                        <p class="text-2xl text-lightGray">
                            London, The UK<br>
                            Antalya, Turkey<br>
                            <span class="text-lg text-gray-500">(Open to remote)</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h5 class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-bold mb-4">Social / Academic</h5>
                        <ul class="space-y-3">
                            <li><a href="https://pbellisan.github.io/" class="text-xl text-lightGray hover:text-brand transition-colors" target="_blank">Github</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://rug.academia.edu/PBellisan" class="text-xl text-lightGray hover:text-brand transition-colors" target="_blank">Academia</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://researchgate.net/profile/Parla-Bellisan-3" target="_blank" class="text-xl text-lightGray hover:text-brand transition-colors">ResearchGate</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-[90rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 mt-32 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center text-xs text-gray-500">
            <p>© Copyright Parla Bellisan 2018-2026. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 sm:mt-0">Inspired by modern editorial design.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
{% endblock %}

</body>
</html>
